<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Viacom, Young.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Viacom, Young.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Viacom Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate, keeping it as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Said also downgraded Young Broadcasting Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate, maintaining it as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Viacom was off two at 33-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Young fell four to 23-1/4.</p>
</text>
